Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — source-developed working scene
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-10-10
Status: Independent screenplay development under DEC-0019; refinements during production

INT. SERVICE CAFE/PRIYA'S OFFICE - SATURDAY - MORNING

On the table: a neutral question, rewritten until accusations are gone. Case H09-55216, not Zoe or the yellow-coat girl. Base NV-CF/4419; disputed supplement NV-CF/4419-S.

PRIYA DEY reads the redacted excerpt. Independent of Mac's chain, she knows a historic contractor audit yielded materially different authorities. No drive or Zoe location.

REQUEST: Did North Vale issue this supplemental authority on that date, granting recovery, transport or relocation powers?

She sends it to North Vale's current published legal-services contact.

INT. NORTH VALE OFFICES - LATER

Records staff find the base and use their own internal directory, not the disputed number. The retired file lawyer is consulted. The supplement is absent and the claimed powers inconsistent with the department's authority.

INT. CAFE - MIDDAY

A phone summary arrives. Zoe restrains her first response.

ZOE
Priya says they said no. Wait for writing.

Later, a redacted written response confirms the base reference, no supplement record, no issued instrument conferring those powers. It cannot determine whether the passage was altered, created elsewhere or falsely attributed.

Zoe reads that last limit twice.

North Vale retains its sent record. Priya the original reply. Voss and the pair hold separate redacted copies, apart from the archive.

INT. NORTH VALE - AFTERNOON

The department opens its own incident: possible unauthorised representation of legal powers. It exists without knowledge of Zoe.

INT. VOSS AND VALE'S ROOM - SAME DAY

Vale aligns dispatch timestamps. Provisional transport before authority could be ordinary. A specific permanent receiving destination was already confirmed before the claimed supplement arrived.

VALE
The destination waited for the order.

INT. CAFE - LATER

Zoe writes DECISION FIRST, then corrects it at Elias's question.

ZOE
Destination first. Authority later. That's what we can prove.

INT. MAC'S STUDY/CAIN'S OFFICE - INTERCUT

Both hear the purported authority has failed outside verification. Mac considers pressure, then stops it. North Vale's present legal and governance records are beyond his old verification loop.

INT. HOTEL - NIGHT

The written contradiction is stored separately from the drive.

ZOE
One authority, one case. Not everything. But this record doesn't disappear if my drive does.

She leaves her own order closed. Next: what the contractors did when they believed such paper.
